Thank you for the call; we noted your team's ongoing frustration with the clunky multiple file upload process, which currently forces handlers to attach documents one at a time. We also confirmed that policyholder letters continue to be generated via the letters tab and agreed to schedule a follow-up session next Thursday to review reporting outputs.

*   **Claim search refinements (ID 4128):** This feature allows users to filter claims by date range, status, and type, helping locate specific entries more efficiently. Please note this is available when the announced release bundle is switched on by feature flag."
